  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, the first <math><mn>3</mn></math> terms of the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;are <math><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>And product <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1155</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>11</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1155</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>121</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1155</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>105</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>121</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>105</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math> the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p>The&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term of an&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;with first term&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and common difference&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>47</mn></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math> the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
